        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Join the Myth Makers in their latest adventure... Trixie in Toyland! The evil Penumbra, leader of the Acrostic Riders has stolen the Myth Makers Orbs and has hidden it from Toyland. Trixie must explore every inch of Toyland and find the stolen orbs and return balance to the Myth realm. But its not going to be easy! Along her way, Trixie must do battle with killer clows, rampaging robots, and hovering helecopters!",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "¡Únete a los Myth Makers en su última aventura... Trixie in Toyland! El malvado Penumbra, líder de los Acrostic Riders, ha robado los Myth Makers Orbs y los ha escondido en Toyland. Trixie debe explorar cada rincón de Toyland, encontrar los orbes robados y restablecer el equilibrio en el Reino Myth. ¡Pero no será fácil! En su camino, Trixie deberá enfrentarse a payasos asesinos, robots desbocados y helicópteros que sobrevuelan el lugar.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
